    "caption": "🇸🇦Al-Farabi ScaleUp is the first accelerator program in Saudi Arabia exclusively organized for startups from Central Asia.\n\n🤝 Together with Plug and Play’s experienced team in the MENA region, 15 projects will gain direct access to key players in the Saudi IT ecosystem, including corporations, venture funds, and business partners. The most promising projects will be guaranteed investment from Tumar Venture Fund.\n\nProject stages: Mature (Seed / Post-Seed and later), tech companies that have found PMF in their home region and are ready to scale in MENA.\n\nAs part of the program, participants will have access to a wide range of resources: 🌟 Mentorship from leading market experts\n📚 Seminars on key aspects of business and technology development\n🤝 Networking with potential investors and strategic partners\n✍️The program consists of 6 weeks online and 8 weeks offline\n🏘 Accommodation for 2 months included\n\nRegister via the link in bio.",
